  _displayName: Freed
  _description: Aldric expresses gratitude after being released and prepares to offer
    his quest.
  _speakerName: Sir Aldric
  _dialogueText: 'By the light... I had nearly forgotten what it felt like to stand
    without chains.

    You have my gratitude, stranger. Yet there is something
    I must ask of you.'
